<title>JAPAN: Kyosan Electric -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyosan Electric -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 26.61		vs	   23.93</p>
<p> Operating	    1.45		vs	    1.13</p>
<p> Current		1.55		vs	    1.16</p>
<p> Net		  835    million    vs	  619    million</p>
<p> EPS		   13.29 yen	  vs	    9.86 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     63 million	  vs	  63 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyosan Electric Manufacturing Co Ltd is a signal maker, with railway and road signals, and power sources as three mainlines.</p>
</text>
